        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rarity_Bay%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community rests in the shadows of the Smoky Mountains and is surrounded on three sides by Tellico Lake's azure waters.",
